                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="journey-v2-bottom">
                      <div class="journey-v2-card">
                        <div class="font-h5 body-font">Expanding Horizons</div>
                        <div class="media-frame journey-v2"><img src="/images/Container-18.webp" alt="Bright living room with large windows showing green trees outside, beige sofas with cushions, a wooden coffee table with books and flowers, neutral tones, and a floor lamp." sizes="(max-width: 1020px) 100vw, 1020px" srcset="/images/Container-18-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Container-18-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Container-18.webp 1020w" class="journey-image-v2" /></div>
