                        <div class="font-h5 body-font">The Idea Takes Shape</div>
                        <div class="media-frame journey-v2"><img src="/images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1.webp" alt="Bright living room with large windows showing green trees outside, beige sofas with cushions, a wooden coffee table with books and flowers, neutral tones, and a floor lamp." sizes="(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px" srcset="/images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/5f7daaa29a17017395ed202082cb76adf4bcec0c-1.webp 2400w" class="journey-image-v2" /></div>
